source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A word behind the dash run leaves the item its text, so the space between them is no reason for Jira to read the run alone.
-- input.jira --
* ---- y
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>---- y</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- \---- y
-- warnings.json --
[]
